## Visibility — what is left

### Scoping: what a contact may see of you

- [ ] **The residual: a rosterless sender naming a Cell nobody has claimed.**
  What is left after the above is narrow but real — a contact we hold no roster
  for, naming a Cell that appears in no roster we hold, can still pre-occupy
  that `(actor_cell, hlc)`. It hurts only if we later pair with the Organ that
  Cell turns out to belong to AND their real op carries the exact stamp that
  was guessed. Closing it properly means refusing, which means the quarantine
  ring needs a replay path first — so this box is really a request for
  quarantine to become re-processable. It sits here rather than with the identity work because nothing about
  reachability or identity closes it — it needs the quarantine follow-ons this
  group already holds.

### Devices you can narrow instead of only revoking

- [ ] **A stolen phone can be NARROWED as well as revoked**, which is the
  humane version — losing a device should not require reissuing an identity.
  The mechanism is built; the act of editing one Cell's capabilities is not
  exposed anywhere.
